# ── LWS runtime & local config ───────────────────────────────────────
# Server state: TDB2 dataset, binary blobs, webhook signing keys.
lws-data/
# Local runtime configuration may contain owner WebIDs and lws.oidc.client-secret.
# Unanchored on purpose: the root-anchored form left src/main/resources/lws.properties — which is
# ON THE CLASSPATH of the shipped jar — perfectly committable.
lws.properties
# Transient smoke-test artifacts, anchored to the root so they cannot silently swallow a future
# src/test/resources fixture that happens to share a name.
/*.err
/cp.txt
/note.ttl
/patch.rq
/sub.json
/locked.acl.ttl

# ── Logs & local environment ─────────────────────────────────────────
*.log
# Demo scripts read admin/user credentials from the environment; never commit a
# local file that captures them.
.env
.env.local
